meta {
  name: packages
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/public/packages/?lang=en
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  lang: en
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Every active package, for the "Simple, Transparent Pricing" section. Not
  paginated -- there are only a handful.

  `is_first_lesson` marks the discounted Assessment & First Lesson, which is the
  primary card and can only be bought once per student. `validity_days` is how
  long the package stays usable after purchase (90 for the 10-class, 180 for the
  20-class).

  `lang` is `en` or `es`; a missing Spanish translation falls back to English.

  `teacher_count` is how many teachers the package can be booked with, so the
  pricing card can say "4 teachers available" before step 2.

  `GET /public/packages/<id>/` returns a single package in the same shape, and
  `GET /public/packages/<id>/teachers/` is booking step 2.

  ## API example response
  [
    {
      "id": "2da599cd-ed31-4aa1-b919-0828e1f2e2e9",
      "image_url": "",
      "total_classes": 1,
      "validity_days": 90,
      "price": "12.00",
      "is_first_lesson": true,
      "sort_order": 0,
      "teacher_count": 4,
      "title": "Spanish Assessment & First Lesson",
      "description": "A 60-minute session: level assessment, a personalised learning plan, and your first full lesson. One per student.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "id": "347cde65-90ad-4178-8816-332e19e04748",
      "image_url": "",
      "total_classes": 10,
      "validity_days": 90,
      "price": "135.00",
      "is_first_lesson": false,
      "sort_order": 2,
      "teacher_count": 4,
      "title": "10-Class Package",
      "description": "10 x 60-minute private lessons. Valid for 3 months.",
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ]

  ## Changelog
  - 2026-09-05: Added `teacher_count` to each package.
}
